    "candidate_gate": "SkirmishStartingBuildingsService.Step missing configured footprint key. Normal publication clamps published footprints to >=1 so an absent row is the specific static gap, not a zero/negative authored footprint.",
    "not_a_key_typo": "VisualKey and actual prefab consistently use Building_Satelite_Dish; normalization trims/lowercases only."
  },
